I'm uploading the following freely redistributable software for the Psion
Series 3.  Many were uploaded to various sites in the UK, but don't seem
to have made it across the Atlantic, and in any case, they have been
improved.  All the games are well tested and include full source in SIBO C.
With the new release of the C SDK for the S3a, all the below should be
rewritten in due course.  Comments are, of course, welcome.  I am holding
back several other utils, which aren't very polished, and am working on a
couple of other games.  Also, the Deja Vu viewer isn't particularly
polished, although it's fast and versatile.

Klondike 1.0 - a solitaire card game : KLNDKE.ZIP

Pyramid 1.0 - a solitaire card game : PYRMID.ZIP

S3Tris 1.1 - a Tetris game : S3TRIS.ZIP     

Solipeg 1.0 - a solitaire (marble/peg) game : SOLPEG.ZIP

Las Vegas Video Poker 1.1 - a video poker game : VEGAS.ZIP

YatZ 1.1 - a Yacht dice game : YATZ.ZIP       

Slide 1.0 - a sliding puzzle game : SLIDE.ZIP       

Deja Vu 2.0 - a multi-file-type auto-detecting viewer : DEJAVU.ZIP

